<title>USA: IPO FILING -- Coral Systems Inc.</title>
<headline>IPO FILING -- Coral Systems Inc.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1996-10-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Company Name		 Coral Systems Inc</p>
<p>Estimated price range	   $10-$12/shr</p>
<p>Total shares to be offered    2.7 million</p>
<p>Shrs offered by company	 2.7 million</p>
<p>Shrs outstanding after ipo    9,930,137</p>
